@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@
+# Gramps - a GTK+/GNOME based genealogy program
+#
+# Copyright (C) 2007-2009  Douglas S. Blank <doug.blank@gmail.com>
+# Copyright (C) 2026  Brian Caudill
+#
